.searchfilters
  Filtros actuales —
  - active_filters.each do |filter|
    %span.searchfilters__filter
      %span.searchfilters__label #{MESSAGES[filter]}: #{send("filter_#{filter}".to_sym)}
      = link_to feather_icon('x', class: 'searchfilters__icon'), helpers.derive_search_url(filter => nil), class: 'searchfilters__link', aria: { label: t('.remove_filter') }
